    {"claim": "A distributed, appealable obligation still presupposes the victim can identify the responsible node and trigger it — and that presupposition is the entire fight.", "targets": ["AN-2"], "relationship": "concedes_and_pivots"},
    {"claim": "Every clock they designed starts only after a 16-year-old has already discovered the fabricated image, documented it, and filed a verified report.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "If the named-person refusal is genuinely load-bearing, it is not a courtesy — it is accountability at the component layer, the exact layer both of you agreed to exempt.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "The actor being audited controls the proof of its own compliance, and that burden falls hardest on women and girls already doing the documentation for free.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "For both positions to hold, one thing has to be true: that allocating a duty is the same as delivering a remedy. It is not.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""}
  ]
}

