    {"claim": "For that case — the centralized, monetized, domestically-hosted commercial site — graceful degradation is not a slogan, it's a mechanism.", "targets": ["AN-21"]},
    {"claim": "Distribution-stage liability becomes a remedy rather than a duty pointing at nobody only if one of three enforcement reaches exists for the offshore case — and all three must operate without host cooperation and without a surviving stamp.", "targets": ["AN-13", "AN-21"]},
    {"claim": "A single re-encode strips the provenance stamp AND defeats perceptual hash-matching in the same operation — that isn't defense-in-depth, it's three locks on the same door that one key opens.", "targets": ["AN-21"]},
    {"claim": "The highest-yield triggerable node for that victim is a human being a detective can arrest by Friday — not Cloudflare, not a hash database, not a payment processor.", "targets": []},
